 <license uri="https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT">MIT License</license>
 <notes>
- Initial development release (0.1.0-dev)
- Phase 1: Infrastructure (shm double-buffer, config, log)
- Phase 2: Domain service (health calculation, node selection + LB)
- Phase 3: Lifecycle (governance worker spawn/monitor/restart, C->PHP callback)
- Phase 4: PHP API (Beacon class, Beacon\Governance class)
 </notes>
